From: Abzu Project <build@abzu.local>
Subject: [ABZU 001] Identify Abzu builds in version string

Minimal patch #1 of the Abzu set: stamp the kernel version string so
userland (and bug reports) can distinguish Abzu builds from stock Darwin.
Nothing else changes — we deliberately keep the diff surface tiny so
rebasing onto new apple-oss-distributions tags stays cheap.

Index: xnu/os/version.c
===================================================================
--- xnu.orig/os/version.c
+++ xnu/os/version.c
@@ -XX,X +XX,X @@
-char   osversion[] = "Darwin Kernel Version " XNU_KERNEL_VERSION ": ";
+char   osversion[] = "Abzu (Darwin Kernel) Version " XNU_KERNEL_VERSION ": ";
